      "cooked": "<p>So we have a Variant heavy week this week</p><p>Vanilla&nbsp;Baron Blade vs Visionary Unleashed, Setting Sun Ra, EXTREEEEEEME Haka,&nbsp;<span>EXTREEEEEEME Fanatic,&nbsp;</span><span>EXTREEEEEEME Tempest in insula primalis.&nbsp;</span></p><p>Was a very fun fight. There are some probably horrible misplays I made but making it so the Barron had to play the same card 3 times was fun. Also skipping Haka's turn whilst ground point and the volcanic eruption was out was a great bit of amusement to me.&nbsp;</p><p>Mint with everyone in low 20's high teens.&nbsp;</p>",
