      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/278dde/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2018-05-29T13:43:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Mint.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Played fast and reckless -- damage flying all over the place. Baron Blade bit the dust pretty quick.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Saw the Volcano, but Tempest ended the game before it erupted.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Visionary 13HP, Ra 16HP, Haka 15HP, Fanatic 3HP, Tempest 17HP. Fanatic was at 3 because she used an Obsidian Field-boosted Divine Sacrifice (hitting Blade all three times, thanks to her base power) and on the next turn, Blade did a Slash and Burn, which hit Fanatic with both instances of damage.</p>",
