      "username": "Gus_Smedstad",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/e8c25b/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2018-05-29T18:36:53.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>My mind-controlled T-Rex never got to hit Blade because I knocked Blade down first. The T-Rex wanted to, of course.</p><p>You people playing with volcanoes must have used Ra’s base power less than I did. I never saw Flesh of the Sun God, presumably because his base power threw the card away. I don’t tend to track exactly which cards the power is eating. Since I couldn’t make my team immune, Tempest flooded the volcano.</p>",
