      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bolnerap/{size}/6056_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-05-29T22:05:22.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I never saw Flesh of the Sun God either - might be a reshuffle thing based on whether one leads with Summon Staff or not.</p><p>Regardless, by the time the Volcano got to do anything (it skipped a round of damage thanks to Ground Pound), Blade was already dead. Primordial Plant Life did more damage to me than anything else did.</p>",
