      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rjc917/{size}/1888_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-05-30T12:42:20.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was paying attention to what cards Ra's base power got rid of and Flesh of the Sun God was never one of them, but I never drew it either.&nbsp; I played Summon Staff first.&nbsp; It didn't really matter though, since the game was over the first time the volcano erupted (I could have ended it on Tempest's turn, but decided to give the Volcano the honor with Blade at 1 hp).</p>",
