    {
      "id": 218758,
      "name": "FearLord",
      "username": "FearLord",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/f/5f8ce5/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2018-06-01T09:18:30.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Easy Mint. Volcano Eruption finished Blade off.</p><p>Nothing too tricky card play wise and I even made a HUGE misplay that pretty much took Fanatic out of commission for a turn (targeted Fanatic with Divine Sacrifice thinking that I’d used her base power on Blade last turn when I had in fact used it on the Mobile Defense Platform before it was destroyed - therefore, not only could I not redirect any of the damage, all of Fanatic’s damage would have redirected to her, so I couldn’t use her base power either...)</p><p>No one in any real danger.</p>",
      "post_number": 12,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:50:56.238Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
