      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/e8c25b/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2018-06-01T12:04:03.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It seems to me that Summon Staff is the smart first-turn play for Ra. I’m assuming that the players who got Flesh of the Sun God may have played Summon Staff as well - but did things slightly differently with the earlier heroes, which would change the shuffle.</p>",
