    {
      "id": 218760,
      "name": "MindWanderer",
      "username": "MindWanderer",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
      "created_at": "2018-06-02T20:05:07.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I went hyper-aggressive and won in round 4, despite drawing very little damage for Haka or Tempest. Twist the Ether went on Fanatic because I knew she was about to do 4 instances of damage in one turn. Tempest actually double-skipped twice: once because he had nothing but Into the Stratospheres and Flash Flood in his hand and once just to let the volcano win. Haka went down in round 3 saving Ra from himself, but everyone else was very healthy, even Fanatic.</p>",
